      "content": "hey i need help writing an email to my boss. im the head of dev for a project in seattle and we are getting hit with way too much scope creep lately. basically more and more features keep getting added to the sprint without us getting more people or more time. i need to ask for either more headcount or a later deadline so we dont crash. can u help me draft something professional?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
