      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft of an email:\n\nSubject: Feedback on Project Scope and Resource Allocation\n\nDear [Boss's Name],\n\nI wanted to discuss the workload and scope creep impacting our current project in Seattle. As you're aware, the number of features being added to our sprints has increased significantly, causing concerns about the feasibility of meeting the original deadline. I'm finding it challenging to manage the existing resources and risk delivering a quality product within the current timeline. I'd like to request either more headcount to augment our development team or consider adjusting the deadline to ensure we can deliver the outstanding scope on a sustainable timeline. I'd appreciate the opportunity to discuss this further and explore options that work best for the project.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]",
